Fixed a regression in `2026.0.2` that caused the Edge operator to crash while upgrading deployments originally installed with versions earlier than `2025.0.7`. The issue occurred because the Edge custom resource (CR) in these deployments did not contain the `spec.cumulocityPasswordSecretName` field, which was introduced in `2025.0.7`. The operator now correctly handles these upgrades without crashing.
